Package: sfdepmap
Title: Moran, LISA and Getis-Ord Maps for Teaching Spatial Statistics
Version: 0.2.2
Authors@R:
    person("Helen", "Greatrex", email = "hlg5155@psu.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Functions written for Penn State spatial statistics courses.
    Each function takes an 'sf' dataset, a column name, a neighbour list and
    spatial weights, and makes one finished plot: a Moran scatterplot, a LISA
    (Local Moran's I) map, Getis-Ord Gi and Gi* hot spot maps, or a four-map
    summary figure. The maps are built with 'tmap' and are sized to fit
    R Markdown and Quarto reports.
